  abstract  = "Abstract. Recent studies have examined temporal fluctuations in
               the amount and carbon isotope content (δ13C) of CO2 produced by
               respiration of roots and soil organisms. These changes have been
               correlated with diel cycles of environmental forcing (e.g.,
