  volume    =  57,
  number    =  11,
  pages     =  1190,
  abstract  = "Over time, we have come to recognize a very complex network of
               physiological changes enabling wound healing. An immunological
               process enables the body to distinguish damaged cells and begin a
               cleaning mechanism by separating damaged proteins and cells with
               matrix metalloproteinases, a complement reaction, and free
               radicals. A wide variety of cell functions help to rebuild new
