              conditions or spatially targeted external triggers such as focused
              ultrasound. To enable these possibilities, we present two families
              of tunable, orthogonal, temperature-dependent transcriptional
              repressors providing switch-like control of bacterial gene
              expression at thresholds spanning the biomedically relevant range
