  pages     = "239--264",
  abstract  = "C6 deamination of adenosine (A) to inosine (I) in double-stranded
               RNA (dsRNA) is catalyzed by a family of enzymes known as ADARs
               (adenosine deaminases acting on RNA) encoded by three genes in
