  pages    = "D901--6",
  abstract = "OGEE is an Online GEne Essentiality database. Its main purpose is
              to enhance our understanding of the essentiality of genes. This is
              achieved by collecting not only experimentally tested essential
              and non-essential genes, but also associated gene features such as
              expression profiles, duplication status, conservation across
              species, evolutionary origins and involvement in embryonic
              development. We focus on large-scale experiments and complement
              our data with text-mining results. Genes are organized into data
