              capacities. These strains also lost the ability to immobilize PCA,
              even under current-generating conditions.",
  month    =  jun,
  year     =  2022,
  keywords = "Bound mediators; Extracellular electron transfer; Inverted
              potentials; Mtr pathway; Redox-active metabolite",
  language = "en"
}

