  pages    =  127394,
  abstract = "In this study, a quorum sensing (QS) signal molecule,
              3-oxo-C12-HSL, was supplied into ΔnosZ Pseudomonas microbial
              electrolysis cell system for strengthening the N2O recovery from
              incineration leachate. The resistance for high nitrite loading was
