              be further subdivided biogeographically within the host into
              distinct microhabitats, thereby generating new niche opportunities
              for distinct bacterial species.",
  month    =  may,
  year     =  2022,
  keywords = "Enterobacterales; Escherichia coli; Salmonella; biogeography;
