  author   = "Shimizu, Toru",
  journal  = "Biosensors",
  volume   =  3,
  number   =  2,
  pages    = "211--237",
  abstract = "Escherichia coli Direct Oxygen Sensor (Ec DOS, also known as Ec
              DosP) is a heme-based O2-sensing phosphodiesterase from
              Escherichia coli that catalyzes the conversion of cyclic-di-GMP to
              linear di-GMP. Cyclic-di-GMP is an important second messenger in
