  number   =  1,
  pages    = "54--73",
  abstract = "The two-component system KdpD/KdpE governs K+ homeostasis by
              controlling synthesis of the high affinity K+ transporter KdpFABC.
              When sensing low environmental K+ concentrations, the dimeric
              kinase KdpD autophosphorylates in trans and transfers the
