  journal  = "Science",
  volume   =  307,
  number   =  5707,
  pages    = "251--254",
  abstract = "An autoregulatory transcription-translation feedback loop is
              thought to be essential in generating circadian rhythms in any
              model organism. In the cyanobacterium Synechococcus elongatus, the
              essential clock protein KaiC is proposed to form this type of
