              Because there has been no systematic comparison of the roles of
              the three QS systems in mediating P. aeruginosa virulence in
              various hosts, we compared the virulence of wild-type (WT) P.
              aeruginosa PA14 and a set of isogenic PA14 QS in-frame deletion
              mutants in four selected hosts, the reference plant Arabidopsis
              thaliana (Arabidopsis), the crop plant Brassica napus (canola),
