              Garcia-Garcia, Jose Carlos and Wang, Zeneng and Lusis, Aldons J
              and Hazen, Stanley L and Brown, Jonathan Mark",
  journal  = "Elife",
  volume   =  11,
  abstract = "Obesity has repeatedly been linked to reorganization of the gut
              microbiome, yet to this point obesity therapeutics have been
              targeted exclusively toward the human host. Here, we show that gut
              microbe-targeted inhibition of the trimethylamine N-oxide (TMAO)
              pathway protects mice against the metabolic disturbances
