  volume    =  23,
  number    =  11,
  pages     = "1782--1790",
  abstract  = "With the capabilities to measure redox potentials (EH) at a high
               temporal resolution, scientists have observed diurnal EH that
               occur in a distinct periodicity in soils and sediments. These
               patterns have been disregarded for a long time because minor
               fluctuations of the EH in the tens of mV range are difficult to
