  volume   =  57,
  number   =  16,
  pages    = "3971--3984",
  abstract = "Complete budgets for carbon and oxygen have been constructed for
              cyanobacterial mats dominated by Microcoleus chthonoplastes from
              the evaporating ponds of a salt works located in Guerrero Negro,
              Baja California Sur, Mexico. Included in the budget are measured
