              tumour antigens using both fluorescence and scattered light
              parameters. We further validated the performance of nanoFACS by
              sorting two distinct HIV strains to >95\% purity and confirmed the
              viability (infectivity) and molecular specificity (specific cell
              tropism) of biological nanomaterials sorted with nanoFACS. This
              nanoFACS method provides a unique way to analyse and sort
              functional EV- and viral-subsets with preservation of vesicular
