              Climent-Catala, Alicia and {PixCell iGEM team} and Baldwin, Geoff
              S and O'Hare, Danny and Howe, Christopher J and Zhang, Jenny Z and
              Ouldridge, Thomas E and Ledesma-Amaro, Rodrigo",
  journal  = "bioRxiv",
  pages    = "2021.09.10.459750",
  abstract = "Synthetic biology research and its industrial applications rely on
              the deterministic spatiotemporal control of gene expression.
              Recently, electrochemical control of gene expression has been
              demonstrated in electrogenetic systems (redox-responsive promoters
              used alongside redox inducers and an electrode), allowing for the
