              its importance, it has been challenging to determine how this
              selectivity is achieved and how AHL QS systems evolve and
              diversify. We hypothesized that we could use covariation within
              the protein sequences of AHL synthases and receptors to identify
              selectivity residues. We began by identifying about 6000 unique
