  pages    = "3668--3671",
  abstract = "Shewanella oneidensis is a metal reducer that can use several
              terminal electron acceptors for anaerobic respiration, including
              fumarate, nitrate, dimethyl sulfoxide (DMSO), trimethylamine
              N-oxide (TMAO), nitrite, and insoluble iron and manganese oxides.
              Two S. oneidensis mutants, SR-558 and SR-559, with Tn5 insertions
