  number   =  12,
  pages    = "e0002921",
  abstract = "The Pseudomonas aeruginosa LasR-LasI (LasR-I) quorum sensing
              system regulates secreted proteases that can be exploited by
              cheaters, such as quorum sensing receptor-defective (lasR)
              mutants. lasR mutants emerge in populations growing on casein as a
