  number   =  43,
  pages    = "10275--10285",
  abstract = "The cytoplasmic protein AxDGC2 regulates cellulose synthesis in
              the obligate aerobe Acetobacter xylinum by controlling the
              cellular concentration of the cyclic dinucleotide messenger
              c-di-GMP. AxDGC2 contains a Per-Arnt-Sim (PAS) domain and two
