  author   = "Shatalin, Konstantin and Nuthanakanti, Ashok and Kaushik, Abhishek
              and Shishov, Dmitry and Peselis, Alla and Shamovsky, Ilya and
              Pani, Bibhusita and Lechpammer, Mirna and Vasilyev, Nikita and
