  journal  = "Nature",
  volume   =  436,
  number   =  7054,
  pages    = "1171--1175",
  abstract = "Biofilms are adherent aggregates of bacterial cells that form on
              biotic and abiotic surfaces, including human tissues. Biofilms
              resist antibiotic treatment and contribute to bacterial
