              the TetR21 via direct binding to the promoter region of hprS. The
              R116C mutation in TetR21 significantly reduced its DNA binding
              affinity. Moreover, natural phenazine antibiotics
              (phenazine-1-carboxylic acid and pyocyanin) and a HP analog
