              William A and Saier, Jr, Milton H",
  journal  = "J. Bacteriol.",
  volume   =  186,
  number   =  11,
  pages    = "3516--3524",
  abstract = "We report here the transcriptome analyses of highly expressed
              genes that are subject to catabolite repression or activation
