              efficiency and selectivity of H(2)O(2)-based signaling, it has
              been proposed that oxidation of target proteins may be facilitated
              by H(2)O(2)-scavenging peroxidases. Recently, a peroxidase-based
              protein oxidation relay has been identified in yeast, namely the
