  number    =  1,
  pages     = "291--297",
  abstract  = "From the second-highest dilution in a most-probable-number
               dilution series with lactate and sulfate as substrates and rice
               paddy soil as the inoculum, a strain of Desulfovibrio
               desulfuricans was isolated. In addition to reducing sulfate,
