  volume   =  192,
  number   =  3,
  pages    = "746--754",
  abstract = "ArcBA is a two-component regulatory system of Escherichia coli
              involved in sensing oxygen availability and the concomitant
              transcriptional regulation of oxidative and fermentative
              catabolism. Based on in vitro data, it has been postulated that
