  journal  = "J. Bacteriol.",
  volume   =  199,
  number   =  7,
  abstract = "The alternative sigma factor RpoS is a central regulator of many
              stress responses in Escherichia coli The level of functional RpoS
              differs depending on the stress. The effect of these differing
              concentrations of RpoS on global transcriptional responses remains
              unclear. We investigated the effect of RpoS concentration on the
