              gene to RpoS levels explains the timing of expression as cells
              enter stationary phase and that genes with different RpoS
              sensitivities are enriched for specific functional groups. Thus,
              promoter sensitivity to RpoS is a mechanism that coordinates
              specific cellular processes in response to stresses.",
