  pages    = "eaau1459",
  abstract = "Quorum quenching (QQ) has been reported to be a promising approach
              for membrane biofouling control. Entrapment of QQ bacteria in
              porous matrices is required to retain them in continuously
              operated membrane processes and to prevent uncontrollable biofilm
              formation by the QQ bacteria on membrane surfaces. It would be
