              chain of N414 is hydrogen bonded to the backbone N-H of Q513. The
              simulations predict a lever-like motion of Q513 after Cys adduct
              formation resulting in loss of the interaction between the side
              chain of N414 and the backbone C=O of Q513, and formation of a
