              helix unfolding dynamics and the cellular function of the
              Zdk2-AsLOV2 optogenetic construct. Through this multifaceted
              approach, we show that Q513 and N414 are critical mediators of
              protein structural dynamics, linking the ultrafast (sub-ps)
