              NTUH-K2044. Genes coding for iron uptake systems are encoded in
              adjacencies of T6SS, suggesting that KP T6SS might also play a
              role in ion import. Some of the T6SS genes are comprised in
              syntenic regions. 17 sigma 70-dependent promoter regions were
              identified in Kp52.145, 12 in HS11286 and 12 in NTUH-K2044. Using
              VirtualFootprint algorithm, binding sites for 13 transcriptional
              regulators were found in Kp52.145 and 9 in HS11286 and 17 in
