              suggest that the strong phenotypic variation in spatially
              structured populations might enhance their ability to cope with
              fluctuating environments.",
  month    =  jul,
  year     =  2019,
  keywords = "bacterial biofilms; emergent metabolic gradients; gluconeogenic
              nutrient switch; lag time; phenotypic variation in clonal
              populations; spatially structured populations",
