  pages    = "1808--1820",
  abstract = "AIMS: To investigate the use of confocal Raman microspectroscopy
              (CRM) for the analysis of the structure, composition and
              development of fully hydrated biofilms. METHODS AND RESULTS:
              Pseudomonas aeruginosa PAO1 biofilms were cultured in a flow cell
