               medium using high-resolution NMR spectroscopy. Biofilm porosity,
               thickness, biovolume, and relative diffusion coefficient depth
               profiles were obtained using NMR microimaging. Dissolved oxygen
               concentration was measured to determine the availability of
               oxygen within the biofilm. Under vancomycin-only treatment, the
               biofilm communities switched to fermentation under anaerobic
               condition, as evidenced by high concentrations of formate (7.4 ±
