  journal  = "PLoS One",
  volume   =  8,
  number   =  7,
  pages    = "e68484",
  abstract = "Achromobacter xylosoxidans is an environmental opportunistic
              pathogen, which infects an increasing number of immunocompromised
              patients. In this study we combined genomic analysis of a clinical
              isolated A. xylosoxidans strain with phenotypic investigations of
              its important pathogenic features. We present a complete assembly
              of the genome of A. xylosoxidans NH44784-1996, an isolate from a
