  journal  = "Annu. Rev. Biophys.",
  volume   =  47,
  pages    = "291--313",
  abstract = "The first stage in biological signaling is based on changes in the
              functional state of a receptor protein triggered by interaction of
              the receptor with its ligand(s). The light-triggered nature of
              photoreceptors allows studies on the mechanism of such changes in
