  volume    =  12,
  number    =  5,
  pages     = "e1006080",
  abstract  = "Generally, the second messenger bis-(3'-5')-cyclic dimeric GMP
               (c-di-GMP) regulates the switch between motile and sessile
               lifestyles in bacteria. Here, we show that c-di-GMP is an
               essential regulator of multicellular development in the social
