  volume   =  82,
  number   =  13,
  pages    = "4017--4027",
  abstract = "UNLABELLED: Listeria monocytogenes senses blue light via the
              flavin mononucleotide-containing sensory protein Lmo0799, leading
              to activation of the general stress response sigma factor SigB
              (σ(B)). In this study, we investigated the physiological response
