              oxygen and carbon monoxide non-cooperatively, with very low
              affinities due entirely to slow association rates. FixL P50's for
              oxygen are 17-76 mmHg. FixL's may sense nitric oxide and carbon
              monoxide in addition to oxygen, especially at the low oxygen
              pressures encountered in vivo. Autoxidation rates are about 50
