  volume   =  398,
  number   = "1-2",
  pages    = "132--142",
  abstract = "Putative globins have been identified in 426 bacterial, 32
              Archaeal and 67 eukaryote genomes. Among these sequences are the
              hitherto unsuspected presence of single domain sensor globins
              within Bacteria, Fungi, and a Euryarchaeote. Bayesian phylogenetic
