  volume    =  8,
  pages     = "e41093",
  abstract  = "The physical interactions of growing bacterial cells with each
               other and with their surroundings significantly affect the
               structure and dynamics of biofilms. Here a 3D agent-based model
               is formulated to describe the establishment of simple bacterial
