              biofilms while reducing cytotoxicity to NIH/3T3 model cells.",
  month    =  feb,
  year     =  2019,
  keywords = "antimicrobial peptides; biofilms; cytocompatibility; photodynamic
              therapy; targets",
  language = "en"
}

@ARTICLE{Sharma2018-xl,
