  pages    = "47--52",
  abstract = "Cytochrome cbb3 (or C-type) oxidases are a highly divergent group
              and the least studied members of the heme-copper oxidases (HCOs)
              superfamily. HCOs couple the reduction of oxygen at the end of the
              respiratory chain to the active proton translocation across the
