               bacteriophytochromes work as photoactivated protein kinases. The
               Rhodobacter sphaeroides bacteriophytochrome BphG1 is
               unconventional in that it has GGDEF and EAL output domains, which
               are involved, respectively, in synthesis (diguanylate cyclase)
