              through the ED pathway to channel carbons to EMP, PP, and
              downstream pathways.IMPORTANCE Species of the Pseudomonas genus
              thrive in various nutritional environments and have strong
              biocatalytic potential due to their diverse metabolic
              capabilities. Carbohydrate substrates are ubiquitous both in
              environmental matrices and in feedstocks for engineered
              bioconversion. Here, we investigated the metabolic network for
