              cyclic metabolic network. We also uncovered that mannose
              catabolism was similar to fructose catabolism, despite the
              annotation of a different pathway in the genome. Elucidation of
              the constitutive metabolic network in P. protegens is important
              for understanding its innate carbohydrate processing, thus laying
              the foundation for targeting metabolic engineering of this
              untapped Pseudomonas species.",
