  journal  = "J. Bacteriol.",
  volume   =  199,
  number   =  8,
  abstract = "For Pseudomonas aeruginosa, levels of cyclic di-GMP (c-di-GMP)
              govern the transition from the planktonic state to biofilm
              formation. Type IV pili (T4P) are crucial determinants of biofilm
              structure and dynamics, but it is unknown how levels of c-di-GMP
