              repel worms. PA14 and NO avoidance are mediated by a chemosensory
              neuron (ASJ) and these responses require receptor guanylate
              cyclases and cyclic nucleotide gated ion channels. ASJ exhibits
              calcium increases at both the onset and removal of NO. These
