  volume   =  1863,
  number   =  1,
  pages    = "91--101",
  abstract = "We have analyzed the distribution of mitochondrial contact site
              and cristae organizing system (MICOS) complex proteins and
              mitochondrial intermembrane space bridging complex (MIB) proteins
              over (sub)complexes and over species. The MICOS proteins are
              associated with the formation and maintenance of mitochondrial
