  journal  = "Nature",
  volume   =  555,
  number   =  7698,
  pages    = "623--628",
  abstract = "A few commonly used non-antibiotic drugs have recently been
              associated with changes in gut microbiome composition, but the
              extent of this phenomenon is unknown. Here, we screened more than
