  abstract = "Antibiotic resistance is a serious threat to public health.
              Significant efforts are currently directed toward containment of
              the spread of resistance, finding new therapeutic options
              concerning resistant human and animal pathogens, and addressing
              the gaps in the fundamental understanding of mechanisms of
