              E-cadherin is critically required for skin barrier function.
              Furthermore, WED rescued against biofilm-induced persistent
              inflammation by circumventing nuclear factor kappa B activation
              and its downstream cytokine responses. CONCLUSION: This is the
              first pre-clinical porcine mechanistic study to recognize the
