  pages    = "aaa8870",
  abstract = "Vibrational spectroscopy has been extensively applied to the study
              of molecules in gas phase, in condensed phase, and at interfaces.
              The transition from spectroscopy to spectroscopic imaging of
              living systems, which allows the spectrum of biomolecules to act
