  volume   =  163,
  number   =  11,
  pages    = "1557--1567",
  abstract = "Clinicians often have to deal with infections that are difficult
              to control because they are caused by superbugs resistant to many
              antibiotics. Alternatives to antibiotic treatment include
              antimicrobial photodynamic therapy (aPDT). The photodynamic
              process causes bacterial death, inducing oxidative stress through
