              variability and (2) identify genomic and/or phenotypic divergence
              between the two geographical locations. We performed phenotypic
              characterization of pyoverdine, pyocyanin, motility, biofilm
              formation, and proteolytic activity. We also assessed the degree
              of virulence using the Dictyostelium discoideum amoeba model.
