              prior engineering successes, we present a structure-guided,
              semirational strategy for reversing enzymatic nicotinamide
              cofactor specificity. This heuristic-based approach leverages the
              diversity and sensitivity of catalytically productive cofactor
              binding geometries to limit the problem to an experimentally
              tractable scale. We demonstrate the efficacy of this strategy by
