  author   = "Böl, Markus and Ehret, Alexander E and Bolea Albero, Antonio and
              Hellriegel, Jan and Krull, Rainer",
  journal  = "Crit. Rev. Biotechnol.",
  volume   =  33,
  number   =  2,
  pages    = "145--171",
  abstract = "In recent years, the advances in microbiology show that biofilms
              are structurally complex, dynamic and adaptable systems including
              attributes of multicellular organisms and miscellaneous
              ecosystems. One may distinguish between beneficial and harmful
              biofilms appearing in daily life as well as various industrial
