              lifetime is regulated by effects on the stabilization of the
              initial open complex. Intrinsic DNA opening-closing appears less
              regulated. This noncovalent mechanism and its regulation exhibit
              many analogies to mechanisms of enzyme catalysis.",
  month    =  may,
