              the aging process and how can this knowledge help design
              therapeutic strategies to combat age-associated diseases? Here we
              provide a comprehensive overview of the evolutionarily conserved
              biological processes that alter the rate of aging and discuss
              their link to disease prevention and the extension of healthy life
              span.",
