              redox-sensitive GFP (roGFP2; Mrx1-roGFP2) allowed measurement of
              dynamic changes in intramycobacterial EMSH with unprecedented
              sensitivity and specificity. Using Mrx1-roGFP2, we report the
              first quantitative measurements of EMSH in diverse mycobacterial
              species, genetic mutants, and drug-resistant patient isolates.
