  number   =  2,
  pages    = "184--193",
  abstract = "The circadian clock allows organisms to accurately predict the
              earth's rotation and modify their behavior as a result. Genetic
              analyses in a variety of organisms have defined a mechanism based
              largely on gene expression feedback loops. However, as we delve
              more deeply into the mechanisms of circadian timekeeping, we are
