  journal  = "Mar. Genomics",
  volume   =  14,
  pages    = "47--57",
  abstract = "To date, the association and synchronization between two
              organismal circadian clocks ticking in parallel as part of a
              meta-organism (termed a symbiotic association), have rarely been
              investigated. Reef-building corals exhibit complex rhythmic
              responses to diurnal, lunar, and annual changes. Understanding
