              endogenous whiB7-dependent genes. Transcriptional activation of
              two resistance genes in the whiB7 regulon, tap (a multidrug
              transporter) and erm(37) (a ribosomal methyltransferase), required
              interaction of WhiB7 with their promoters. Furthermore,
              heterologous expression of tap genes isolated from Mycobacterium
              species demonstrated that divergencies in drug specificity of
