               MifS (PA5512) and MifR (PA5511) form one such TCS implicated in
               biofilm formation. MifS is a sensor kinase whereas MifR belongs
               to the NtrC superfamily of transcriptional regulators that
               interact with RpoN (σ54). In this study we demonstrate that the
               mifS and mifR genes form a two-gene operon. The close proximity
