  pages    = "106--118",
  abstract = "Pseudomonas aeruginosa has sets of sensory genes designated che
              and che2. The che genes are required for flagella-mediated
              chemotaxis. The che2 genes are expressed in the stationary phase
              of growth and are probably also involved in flagella-mediated
