              remains as a peripheral zone. In the anaerobic ammonium-oxidising
              (``anammox'' process) chemoautotroph ``Candidatus Brocadia
              anammoxidans'' the interior region bounded by ICM contains a
              further internal single-membrane-bounded region, the anammoxosome.
