              mutants under certain conditions. Interestingly, such mutants
              arise spontaneously under various conditions, including in the
              airways of cystic fibrosis patients. Using transcriptional lacZ
              reporters, LC/MS quantification and phenotypic assays, we have
              investigated the regulation of QS-controlled factors by the las
