               model of the biofilm life cycle that encompasses the three major
               steps of biofilm formation — aggregation, growth and
               disaggregation — independently of surfaces, and initiation from
               single-cell planktonic bacteria, and thus represents a broader
               range of biofilm systems.",
  month     =  aug,
  year      =  2022,
  language  = "en"
}

@ARTICLE{Perez-Garcia2023-nw,
  title    = "Electrochemical analysis of extracellular electron transfer
