  volume   =  9,
  number   =  3,
  pages    = "e1003201",
  abstract = "The two-component system (TCS) KdpD/KdpE, extensively studied for
              its regulatory role in potassium (K(+)) transport, has more
              recently been identified as an adaptive regulator involved in the
              virulence and intracellular survival of pathogenic bacteria,
