              were found, which were previously found in response to cationic
              antimicrobial peptides like LL-37. Therefore, our data provide a
              starting point for a more detailed understanding of C. difficile's
              way to counteract membrane-active compounds. IMPORTANCE C.
              difficile is an important anaerobe pathogen causing mild to severe
