              and virulence",
  author   = "Goldová, Jana and Ulrych, Aleš and Hercík, Kamil and Branny, Pavel",
  journal  = "BMC Genomics",
  volume   =  12,
  pages    =  437,
  abstract = "BACKGROUND: The genome of Pseudomonas aeruginosa contains at least
