  journal  = "bioRxiv",
  pages    = "2022.12.05.519192",
  abstract = "To probe signal propagation and genetic actuation in microbial
              consortia, we have coopted the components of both redox and quorum
              sensing (QS) signaling into a communication network for guiding
              composition by “programming” cell lysis. Here, we use an electrode
