              RpoS controls phenazine methylation by modulating activity of the
              carbon catabolite repression pathway, in which the Hfq/Crc complex
              inhibits translation of the phenazine methyltransferase PhzM. We
              find that RpoS indirectly inhibits expression of CrcZ, a small RNA
              that binds to and sequesters Hfq/Crc, specifically in the oxic
