              we show leads to increased metabolic activity-an apparent
              beneficial effect-in hypoxic/anoxic subpopulations within
              biofilms. However, we also find that biofilms lacking Crc show
              increased sensitivity to an exogenously added methylated
              phenazine, indicating that the increased metabolic activity in
              this mutant comes at a cost. Together, these results suggest that
              complex regulation of PhzM allows P. aeruginosa to simultaneously
