              particularly during inflammation. In this work, we study Mtb
              metabolism of lactate and pyruvate combining classic microbial
              physiology with a 'multi-omics' approach consisting of
              transposon-directed insertion site sequencing (TraDIS), RNA-seq
              transcriptomics, proteomics and stable isotopic labelling coupled
              with mass spectrometry-based metabolomics. We discovered that Mtb
