               to identify and confirm that an orthologue of the Pseudomonas
               fluorescens transcriptional regulator (RccR) binds to the
               upstream region of isocitrate lyase (aceA) in P. aeruginosa,
               thereby repressing flux through the glyoxylate shunt during
               growth on non-C2 carbon sources.",
