               mutational analysis, we show that pyocyanin is the physiological
               signal for the upregulation of these quorum sensing-controlled
               genes during stationary phase and that the response is mediated
               by the transcription factor SoxR. Our results implicate
               phenazines as signalling molecules in both P. aeruginosa PA14 and
               PAO1.",
  month     =  sep,
