  volume    =  14,
  number    =  2,
  pages     = "e0015923",
  abstract  = "Macrophages are crucial components of the host's defense against
               pathogens. Recent studies indicate that macrophage functions are
               influenced by lipid metabolism. However, knowledge of how
               bacterial pathogens exploit macrophage lipid metabolism for their
               benefit remains rudimentary. We have shown that the Pseudomonas
