  number    =  12,
  pages     = "2851--2861",
  abstract  = "Adenosine deaminases (ADAs) play a pivotal role in regulating the
               level of adenosine, an important signaling molecule that controls
               a variety of cellular responses. Two distinct ADAs, ADA1 and
               adenosine deaminase growth factor (ADGF aka ADA2), are known.
