  publisher = "Springer Science and Business Media LLC",
  volume    =  13,
  number    =  1,
  pages     = "1--12",
  abstract  = "AbstractBiocontrol agents are safe and effective methods for
               controlling plant disease pathogens, such as Fusarium solani,
