  author    = "Wei, Zhiyan and Li, Changfu and Song, Fengge and Zhang, Xiaoying
               and Li, Shuyu and Xu, Nuoping and Zhang, Jingchao and Luo, Yan
               and Zuo, Yuxin and Jiao, Jitong and He, Haiyang and Wang, Ruoyi
               and Liu, Xiaozhen and Sun, Zhongke and Yang, Yantao and Wang, Yao
               and Chang, Wenqiang and Lou, Hongxiang and Feng, Jie and Zhao,
