  volume    =  206,
  number    =  1,
  pages     = "25--47",
  abstract  = "AbstractKappa symbionts of two stocks of Paramecium aurelia were
               isolated and their killing activity tested on sensitive
               paramecia. The symbionts from stock 51, which is a hump killer,
               induce sensitive animals to cease the formation of food vacuoles
