  volume   =  226,
  number   =  1,
  abstract = "The impact of exposure to microbial pathogens on animal
              reproductive capacity and germline physiology is not well
              understood. The nematode Caenorhabditis elegans is a bacterivore
              that encounters pathogenic microbes in its natural environment.
              How pathogenic bacteria affect host reproductive capacity of C.
