               muxABC-opmB genes. Tolerance to SDS and EDTA in P. aeruginosa
               biofilms is linked to metabolically active cells, but does not
               depend on the pmr, mexAB, mexCD, mexPQ, or muxABC genes. Our data
               suggest that the active subpopulation in P. aeruginosa biofilms
