  volume    =  27,
  number    =  3,
  pages     =  108835,
  abstract  = "Airway inflammation underlies cystic fibrosis (CF) pulmonary
               exacerbations. In a prospective multicenter study of randomly
               selected, clinically stable adolescents and adults, we assessed
               relationships between 24 inflammation-associated molecules and
               the future occurrence of CF pulmonary exacerbation using
               proportional hazards models. We explored relationships for
