  publisher = "American Chemical Society (ACS)",
  number    = "cbe.5c00015",
  abstract  = "Biosensors exploit the capabilities of biological systems to
               acquire a huge variety of chemical or physical information and
               convert molecular signals into actionable data. Here we took a
               bottom-up synthetic biology approach to combine the versatility
               and programmability of whole-cell bacterial biosensors with the
               sensitivity of electrochemical sensing devices. We built genetic
