               binding for the ability to activate transcription of three
               RhlR-regulated genes: rhlA (PqsE independent), phzM (PqsE
               dependent), and azeB (PqsE inhibited). Analogous assays measuring
               activation of the three genes in P. aeruginosa were performed,
