               from Mexican biodiversity against P. aeruginosa PA14. Alternariol
               4-methyl ether (12), iridoskyrin (17), and
               5,8-epi-dioxyergosta-6,9(11),22-trien-3-ol (39) showed the most
               potent antimicrobial activity at both test concentrations.
               Regarding anti-QS activity, fuscin (13), neosartorin (18),
