               provide insight into the accompanying gene expression changes.",
  month     =  mar,
  year      =  2026,
  keywords  = "Pseudomonas aeruginosa; RNA sequencing; antimicrobial resistance
               (AMR); biofilm; chronic infection; cystic fibrosis (CF); ex vivo
               model; quorum sensing (QS); sulphur metabolism; transcriptome",
