              guanosine tetraphosphate (ppGpp) and guanosine pentaphosphate
              (pppGpp), to less-well-studied signaling molecules, including
              diketopiperazines, fatty acids (diffusible signal factor
              [DSF]-like factors), pyoverdine, and pyocyanin. This overview
