              effective at inhibiting the binding of radio-iodinated diferric
              glycosylated hTF from a commercial source to receptors on HeLa
              cells as the unlabeled recombinant diferric hTF-NG control. Thus,
              the presence of a His tag at either the N- or C-terminus of hTF-NG
