              QS inhibition is a common feature of antibiotics. We present the
              results of a screening of 12 antibiotics for their QS-inhibitory
              activities using a previously described QS inhibitor selector 1
              strain. Three of the antibiotics tested, AZM, ceftazidime (CFT),
