              in which a single N-βGRP molecule has been proposed to bind to a
              triple-helical form of laminarin on the basis of an X-ray
              crystallographic structure of the N-βGRP-laminarihexaose complex
              [Kanagawa, M., Satoh, T., Ikeda, A., Adachi, Y., Ohno, N., and
