              of type 1 and type 2 diabetic patients was 0.489 +/- 0.030 and
              0.296 +/- 0.022 nmol/l, respectively (P < 0.001). Eight of 24
              (33\%) type 2 diabetic patients had subnormal free testosterone
              concentrations (<0.225 nmol/l). Using an age-based reference
