  pages    = "8644--8655",
  abstract = "Pseudomonas quinolone signal (PQS),
              2-heptyl-3-hydroxy-4-quinolone, is an intercellular alkyl
              quinolone signaling molecule produced by the opportunistic
              pathogen Pseudomonas aeruginosa. Alkyl quinolone signaling is an
