              Membrane Transport Proteins/genetics/metabolism Metabolic Networks
              and Pathways/*genetics *Mutation NAD/*metabolism Recombinant
              Proteins/genetics/metabolism",
  language = "en"
}

@ARTICLE{Silby2009-jr,
