              (type I) under iron-limiting conditions can still be stimulated by
              its cognate pyoverdine, suggesting the presence of an alternative
              uptake route for type I ferripyoverdine. In silico analysis of the
              PAO1 genome revealed that the product of gene PA4168 has a high
              similarity with FpvA. Inactivation of PA4168 (termed fpvB) in an
              fpvA mutant totally abolished the capacity to utilize type I
