              III pyoverdines. Inactivation of the fpvB homologues in these
              strains impaired their capacity to utilize type I ferripyoverdine
              as a source of iron. Accordingly, introduction of fpvB in trans
              restored the capacity to utilize type I ferripyoverdine.",
  month    =  jun,
  year     =  2004,
  keywords = "Amino Acid Sequence Bacterial Outer Membrane
