  volume   =  46,
  number   =  1,
  pages    = "1--11",
  abstract = "In Streptomyces coelicolor, bldA encodes the only tRNA for a rare
              leucine codon, UUA. This tRNA is unnecessary for growth, but is
              required for some aspects of secondary metabolism and
              morphological development, as revealed by the phenotypes of bldA
              mutants in diverse streptomycetes. This article is a comprehensive
