              tetracenomycin biosynthesis suggested that ActVA-Orf6 might
              catalyze this transformation as a step in actinorhodin
              biosynthesis. To investigate the role of ActVA-Orf6 in this
              oxidation, we have expressed the actVA-Orf6 gene in Escherichia
              coli and purified and characterized the recombinant protein.
