              tetracenomycin intermediate TcmF1 to TcmD3, strongly suggesting
              that it catalyzes oxidation of a similar intermediate in
              actinorhodin biosynthesis. The monooxygenase obeys simple reaction
              kinetics and has a Km of 4.8 +/- 0.9 microM, close to the figure
              reported for the homologous enzyme TcmH. The enzyme contains no
