              pocket, including the catalytic Cys25 and His162. Selective
              [(15)N]Cys, [(15)N]His, and [(13)C]Met labeling was performed to
              quickly assess cruzain-ligand interactions for a set of eight
              low-molecular weight compounds exhibiting micromolar binding or
