              frequency at which their bacterial orthologs co-occur in the same
              operon in the collection of bacterial genomes. It is found that
              transcription rate data is generally a better parameter for
              functional relatedness than steady state mRNA abundance,
              suggesting transcription rate data is more informative to use in
              deciphering the logics used by the cells in dynamic regulation of
