              in pathogens are a focus of this review. We will cover several
              reactive oxygen species-sensing global regulators in both
              gram-positive and gram-negative pathogenic bacteria in detail. The
              following discussion of the mechanisms that these proteins employ
              to sense redox signals through covalent modification of redox
