  pages    = "242--247",
  abstract = "Background: The objective of this multicenter, parallel,
              double-blind, placebo-controlled clinical trial was to determine
              the efficacy and tolerability of the combination of ebastine 10 mg
              plus pseudoephedrine 120 mg once daily after 3 days of treatment
              in the symptomatic relief of patients with a common cold. Methods:
