              coiled coil packed against peripheral CHR α-helices and an
              intervening loop and helix-turn-helix segments. We previously
              reported that the stability of the MARV GP2 postfusion structure
              is highly pH-dependent, with increasing stability at lower pH
              [Harrison, J. S., Koellhoffer, J. K., Chandran, K., and Lai, J. R.
