              buoyant and motile. Second, increased germ-soma specialization in
              larger colonies increases motility capabilities because
              internalization of nonflagellated germ cells decreases colony
              drag. Third, our analysis yields a limiting maximum size of the
              volvocalean spheroid that agrees with the sizes of the largest
              species known. Finally, the different colony designs in Volvocales
