              of poorly characterized 4-hydroxy-2-alkylquinolines (HAQs)
              previously identified for their antimicrobial activity. Here we
              use liquid chromatography (LC)/MS, genetics, and whole-genome
              expression to investigate the structure, biosynthesis, regulation,
